    "signature": "fn try_new(expr: impl IntoIterator<Item = (Arc<dyn PhysicalExpr>, String)>, input_schema: &SchemaRef) -> Result<Self>",
    "docs": "Constructs the mapping between a projection's input and output\nexpressions.\n\nFor example, given the input projection expressions (`a + b`, `c + d`)\nand an output schema with two columns `\"c + d\"` and `\"a + b\"`, the\nprojection mapping would be:\n\n```text\n [0]: (c + d, [(col(\"c + d\"), 0)])\n [1]: (a + b, [(col(\"a + b\"), 1)])\n```\n\nwhere `col(\"c + d\")` means the column named `\"c + d\"`.",
